@startuml
title Aktivierung eines Integrationsservices durch seine Methodenstreams

autonumber
hide footbox

participant "DeviceIntegrationWorker" as Worker
participant "WorkerServiceProxy\n(Integration.Contracts)" as Proxy
participant "DeviceIntegrationWorkerService" as WorkerService
participant "StreamTrackingJobTransmitter\n<GetDevices>" as TrackingTx
participant "JobTransmitter\n<GetDevices>" as InnerTx
participant "StreamTrackerCoordinator" as Coordinator
participant "ServiceStreamTracker" as ServiceTracker
participant "ServiceDirectory" as Directory
participant "IntegrationDeviceCatalogSynchronizer" as Synchronizer
participant "JobFacade" as Facade
participant "IDeviceIntegration" as Integration
participant "IntegrationDeviceCatalog" as Catalog

Worker -> Proxy : ListenForGetDevicesRequests(service)
Proxy -> WorkerService : gRPC-Stream öffnen
WorkerService -> TrackingTx : GetRequestStream(service, token)
TrackingTx -> InnerTx : GetRequestStream(service, token)
InnerTx --> TrackingTx : IAsyncEnumerable<JobRequest<EmptyDto>>
TrackingTx -> Coordinator : TrackStream(service, GetDevices, requestStream)
Coordinator -> ServiceTracker : GetOrCreate(service) und TrackStream(...)
ServiceTracker --> Coordinator : TrackedStream<JobRequest<EmptyDto>>
Coordinator --> TrackingTx : TrackedStream
TrackingTx --> WorkerService : TrackedStream als IAsyncEnumerable
WorkerService --> Proxy : gRPC-Nachrichtenstrom
Proxy --> Worker : Stream

Worker -> Worker : Stream lesen
ServiceTracker -> ServiceTracker : Zustand GetDevices = Active

alt alle verpflichtenden Methodenstreams sind Active
  ServiceTracker -> Coordinator : Availability = true
  Coordinator -> Directory : RegisterService(service)
  Coordinator -> Synchronizer : ServiceAvailable(service)
  Synchronizer -> Facade : GetDevices gezielt an service
  Facade -> InnerTx : Request in bestehenden Stream einstellen
  InnerTx --> WorkerService : JobRequest<EmptyDto>
  WorkerService --> Proxy : gRPC-Nachricht
  Proxy --> Worker : JobRequest<EmptyDto>
  Worker -> Integration : GetDevices(token)
  Integration --> Worker : devices
  Worker -> Proxy : SendGetDevicesResult(result)
  Proxy -> WorkerService : unary gRPC-Aufruf
  WorkerService -> TrackingTx : NotifyJobResult(result)
  TrackingTx -> InnerTx : delegieren
  InnerTx --> Facade : korreliertes Ergebnis
  Facade --> Synchronizer : devices
  Synchronizer -> Catalog : PublishDeviceSnapshot(service, devices)
else mindestens ein verpflichtender Stream fehlt
  note over ServiceTracker,Directory
    Der Service ist noch nicht routbar und es wird
    noch kein Device-Snapshot abgerufen.
  end note
end

note over TrackingTx,InnerTx
  Der Decorator verändert Jobrouting und Korrelation nicht.
  Er ergänzt nur das Tracking des ausgegebenen Request-Streams.
end note
@enduml
